echo_validator
==============

Write a function:

    def echo_validator(text: str) -> bool

Return True if `text` is a PALINDROME when you ignore all non-
alphanumeric characters and treat letters case-insensitively.

Examples:
    echo_validator("A man, a plan, a canal: Panama")   -> True
    echo_validator("racecar")                          -> True
    echo_validator("hello")                            -> False
    echo_validator("")                                 -> True
